<title>UK: Sri Lanka buys Mexican whites at $337.98/T - trade.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka buys Mexican whites at $337.98/T - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka bought 12,500 tonnes of white sugar in its recent tender, London trade sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The price paid was $337.98 per tonne c &amp; f basis and the origin of the sugar was Mexico, they said. Delivery is set for the first half of June in Colombo.</p>
<p>In February Sri Lanka bought a 12,500-tonne cargo of whites from Gill &amp; Duffus at $336.90 per tonne, with delivery set for between March 15 and April 5.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
